WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.383 --> 00:00:08.323
If a drug that blocks serotonin uptake helps depression, was low serotonin the

2
00:00:08.323 --> 00:00:09.323
cause?

3
00:00:09.617 --> 00:00:11.157
Start with what is established.

4
00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:17.237
SSRI drugs block the serotonin transporter, in the pocket where serotonin binds.

5
00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:22.807
In 1990, Pedro Delgado and colleagues ran a blinded experiment.

6
00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:28.230
They studied 21 patients whose depression had remitted on antidepressants.

7
00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:34.690
Each received a drink with no tryptophan, serotonin's building block, and on another

8
00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:36.150
occasion a control drink.

9
00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:40.393
Neither the patient nor the rater knew which drink was which.

10
00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:45.287
After the tryptophan-free drink, 14 of the 21 relapsed.

11
00:00:46.217 --> 00:00:50.297
They returned to remission within one to two days on normal food.

12
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.920
The control drink had no significant effect.

13
00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:57.870
Does this show that low serotonin causes depression?

14
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.400
It does not. These patients were chosen because an antidepressant had helped them.

15
00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:14.173
The result suggests that some of them needed serotonin to stay well.

16
00:01:14.953 --> 00:01:18.053
A treatment can depend on a transmitter that was never low.

17
00:01:19.067 --> 00:01:21.787
Pooled depletion studies split people by risk.

18
00:01:22.947 --> 00:01:26.947
Healthy volunteers without a family history showed no significant mood drop.

19
00:01:27.747 --> 00:01:29.127
Those with one dropped slightly.

20
00:01:30.267 --> 00:01:32.727
Drug-free people recovered from depression dropped more.

21
00:01:34.117 --> 00:01:39.497
A 2022 review found no consistent support for a low-serotonin cause.

22
00:01:40.377 --> 00:01:42.317
Other researchers dispute its methods.

23
00:01:43.350 --> 00:01:49.350
Meanwhile, a 2018 analysis of trials found 21 antidepressants better than placebo,

24
00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:51.790
for acute major depression in adults.

25
00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:54.910
Certainty ranged from moderate to very low.

26
00:01:55.883 --> 00:02:01.303
Both can be true. Aspirin relieves a headache, yet headaches are not caused by a

27
00:02:01.303 --> 00:02:02.303
lack of aspirin.

28
00:02:03.067 --> 00:02:08.127
Still, the tryptophan experiment suggests that some treated patients need serotonin

29
00:02:08.127 --> 00:02:09.127
to stay well.

30
00:02:09.917 --> 00:02:13.617
The takeaway: a drug's mechanism is evidence about the drug.

31
00:02:14.457 --> 00:02:16.477
It is not proof of what causes the disease.
